cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Si usas geoecu, cítalo así. / If you use geoecu, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "geoecu: Maps of the Provinces, Cantons and Parishes of Ecuador (Mapas de Provincias, Cantones y Parroquias del Ecuador)"
abstract: >-
  Boundaries of the provinces, cantons and parishes of Ecuador as 'sf'
  objects, identified by the codes of the national political-administrative
  division (DPA), ready to be mapped and joined with health, epidemiological
  surveillance or other data. Derived from the open data of the Territorial
  Organization of the State published by CONALI (Ministry of Government of
  Ecuador) under a CC BY licence.
authors:
